# Build context for docker/liara-documentation-builder/Dockerfile.
#
# The Dockerfile COPYs only docker/, mdbook/, doxygen/, and
# shared-content/assets/ — everything below is genuinely unused at build
# time and would otherwise be uploaded to the docker daemon for nothing
# (shared-content/fonts/ especially, which is sizeable).

.git
.github
.idea
.vscode

docs
hub
tests

shared-content/doxygen
shared-content/fonts
shared-content/hub
shared-content/mdbook
shared-content/navbar
shared-content/tokens

*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*.DS_Store